{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASCENDANT, where you, your squad of unlikely heroes, and four biocores are all that stand between survival and total annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/231723cbeea329e0db0b7816fc706404.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCENDANT is capture-the-flag... on crack. After a thousand-year cryo-nap, you wake up to find the world\u2019s gone to sh*t: mutant wildlife, rogue tech, and rival squads battling for biocores filled with amber that keep your Shade alive. The catch? Every match is different. Thanks to the virtual Game Director, biocore locations, available rooms, and wild events shift with every game, forcing you to adapt... or die. Four teams, four biocores\u2026 you do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/c0167e188a7657c5da00d4a2e93b9d62.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Spend power wisely - your team\u2019s collective pool grows as you fight mutant creatures, and how you use it can mean the difference between victory and a humiliating respawn. Unlock weapons and items mid-match to outsmart your enemies. Whether you\u2019re upgrading your gear, setting traps, or going full kamikaze, victory comes down to one thing: adapting fast - because the map\u2019s out to ruin your best-laid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/3821b925fd1b618227d0a9a619836902.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are ever the same. Dynamic events, from sudden airstrikes to mutated mega-beasts, can flip the game on its head, ruining even the most carefully planned strategy. Lethal creatures and environmental hazards keep the stakes high and the chaos higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/53cd98285c99b6d518af10f5ef7954f9.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the gun the government warned you about. From grenade-launching sniper rifles to poison-spitting SMGs, ASCENDANT\u2019s weapon customization offers 3 million mod combinations, letting you craft the ultimate overkill machine. But no matter how good your Franken-gun is, someone\u2019s probably built something bigger, badder, and aimed it right at your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/eee6d8e8cfebeb358acf3764db4da006.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your character\u2019s abilities and perks to suit your playstyle, whether you\u2019re the ultimate biocore thief or the squad\u2019s chaotic wildcard. Between matches, head to the social lobby, duel frenemies, or gear up for more mayhem. Or, if you\u2019re craving an extra dose of carnage, enter the Thunderdome - a PvP arena where the only goal is to leave in one piece (and with bragging rights).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s brutal. It\u2019s BioPunk. It\u2019s survival with zero hand-holding... but it does have an epic soundtrack ('Final Countdown' anyone?). ASCENDANT keeps the action unpredictable and the stakes as high as your blood pressure. Bring your wits, your best squad, and maybe a will. You\u2019re going to need all three.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1803110?t=1770748251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770748251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/81a73918e67361e1cb6162a2d05afe723bcfcb1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770748251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/81a73918e67361e1cb6162a2d05afe723bcfcb1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770748251","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"ASCENDANT's main Gameplay involves violence and combat against other players and fantasy creatures."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join us on Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/77d744cbb131c26cdec669dfe9e47b36.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=147 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASCENDANT, where you, your squad of unlikely heroes, and four biocores are all that stand between survival and total annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/231723cbeea329e0db0b7816fc706404.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCENDANT is capture-the-flag... on crack. After a thousand-year cryo-nap, you wake up to find the world\u2019s gone to sh*t: mutant wildlife, rogue tech, and rival squads battling for biocores filled with amber that keep your Shade alive. The catch? Every match is different. Thanks to the virtual Game Director, biocore locations, available rooms, and wild events shift with every game, forcing you to adapt... or die. Four teams, four biocores\u2026 you do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/c0167e188a7657c5da00d4a2e93b9d62.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Spend power wisely - your team\u2019s collective pool grows as you fight mutant creatures, and how you use it can mean the difference between victory and a humiliating respawn. Unlock weapons and items mid-match to outsmart your enemies. Whether you\u2019re upgrading your gear, setting traps, or going full kamikaze, victory comes down to one thing: adapting fast - because the map\u2019s out to ruin your best-laid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/3821b925fd1b618227d0a9a619836902.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are ever the same. Dynamic events, from sudden airstrikes to mutated mega-beasts, can flip the game on its head, ruining even the most carefully planned strategy. Lethal creatures and environmental hazards keep the stakes high and the chaos higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/53cd98285c99b6d518af10f5ef7954f9.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the gun the government warned you about. From grenade-launching sniper rifles to poison-spitting SMGs, ASCENDANT\u2019s weapon customization offers 3 million mod combinations, letting you craft the ultimate overkill machine. But no matter how good your Franken-gun is, someone\u2019s probably built something bigger, badder, and aimed it right at your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/eee6d8e8cfebeb358acf3764db4da006.avif?t=1770748251\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.poster.avif?t=1770748251\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.webm?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.mp4?t=1770748251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your character\u2019s abilities and perks to suit your playstyle, whether you\u2019re the ultimate biocore thief or the squad\u2019s chaotic wildcard. Between matches, head to the social lobby, duel frenemies, or gear up for more mayhem. Or, if you\u2019re craving an extra dose of carnage, enter the Thunderdome - a PvP arena where the only goal is to leave in one piece (and with bragging rights).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s brutal. It\u2019s BioPunk. It\u2019s survival with zero hand-holding... but it does have an epic soundtrack ('Final Countdown' anyone?). ASCENDANT keeps the action unpredictable and the stakes as high as your blood pressure. Bring your wits, your best squad, and maybe a will. You\u2019re going to need all three.</p>","developers":["PlayFusion"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/ab2cc8f6fd1b3c3754c44dd9876dad54c246bca9/header.jpg?t=1770748251","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 - PlayFusion Ltd has bases in the United Kingdom and the United States of America.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1803110/1329054105/bde87ac4b18626c25681e49335fd611aee3b6450/1770132612/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770133255","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1803110/1329054105/bde87ac4b18626c25681e49335fd611aee3b6450/1770132612/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770133255","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1803110/1329054105/bde87ac4b18626c25681e49335fd611aee3b6450/1770132612/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770133255","id":257278554,"name":"ASCENDANT | Convoyer Trials Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257278554/69d0f1ab4ca7a6cb8d17b3ccb85d63c20f497648/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770133255"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1803110/842071/bc8b0fcf8a739a2f13ddc7e06998ec2650e5d610/1751032552/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740767497","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1803110/842071/bc8b0fcf8a739a2f13ddc7e06998ec2650e5d610/1751032552/dash_h264.mpd?t=174076749